# Build output. A local `go build -o milestoned-plan-dag ./cmd/milestoned-plan-dag`
# (or its Windows .exe form) drops a binary at the repo root; ignore both.
# /dist/ is where GoReleaser writes snapshot and release artifacts.
/milestoned-plan-dag
/milestoned-plan-dag.exe
/dist/

# Go test/coverage artifacts
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt
coverage.html

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Orchestrator run scratch (checkpoints, event journal) — never committed
.conductor-tmp/
